<title>SPAIN: Bankers Trust names new Spanish chairman.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust names new Spanish chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Tabacalera chairman Pedro Perez was named chairman of Bankers Trust in Spain on Friday while Julio Garcia was appointed managing director.</p>
<p>Perez, relieved at the helm of Spain's state-owned tobacco manufacturer in June, will develop Bankers Trust's corporate and institutional relations and its strategy in Spain.</p>
<p>He will act as consultant to Bankers Trust Company on international strategy and in relation to large clients in Europe and Latin America.</p>
<p>Garcia was formerly responsible for the private banks group of Bankers Trust Spain.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2161</p>
